
ScrGrb 0.1 
^^^^^^^^^^
 
ScrGrab is a small System-X door that grabs
SysOp's WB (using cybergrab) and send it to
user.

REQUIREMENTS
^^^^^^^^^^^^

System-X bbs software
(only tested whit 1.5 but it shuld works whit earlier versions)

Cybergram

About 1meg free memory
(ScrGrb puts the image on ram: until the user has DL'd it)

INSALLATION
^^^^^^^^^^^

Run the door like any XIM (/X) door...

IMPORTANT
^^^^^^^^^

This door will *NOT* work whit any other /X clone.
This is because I'm to lazy to use XIMfunctions.. =)
Mail me if you want an /X compatible version..

